arbeitnow:senior-programme-manager-techn:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About THG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our leading retailers and brands, including LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD and Cult Beauty, make up our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Icon 1, WA15 0AF &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Technical Programme Manager to lead the delivery of our most important customer-facing technology programmes, reporting directly to the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Chief Technology Officer&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;THG runs several high-profile ecommerce websites in nutrition and beauty, including myprotein.com and lookfantastic.com. Our websites and mobile apps are how customers find, buy and come back to our brands, and the programmes you lead will shape that experience directly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own programmes from first idea to launch, mainly across our websites and mobile apps. Examples include personalisation, loyalty and digital marketing technology, and some programmes will reach into other parts of the technology estate. The role is an even mix of programme and project management. You will run long-lived programmes that span many teams, and drive individual projects hands-on when they need it. You will work with executives to decide what gets built and in what order, and tell them plainly how delivery is going.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t need to be the architect. Our technology leaders set the technical direction and you will follow their lead. You do need to understand how large websites and apps are built well enough to plan the work, spot risks early and ask the right questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Technical Programme Manager you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programme Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Own the delivery of large technology programmes across our websites and mobile apps, from scoping and planning through to launch and review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programme Planning:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Build and maintain programme plans, milestones and dependency maps across several engineering and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Run individual projects directly when a programme needs it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prioritisation &amp;amp; Product Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Prioritisation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Bring options, costs and trade-offs to executives and secure a clear decision on what comes first.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backlog Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Manage the backlog for your programmes so engineering teams always know what is next and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work with product managers to turn business goals into well-defined, deliverable pieces of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting, Risk &amp;amp; Vendors&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Honest Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Give executives and stakeholders clear, candid updates on progress, risks and dates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Dependency Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Find risks, blockers and cross-team dependencies early, resolve them, and escalate when a decision is needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hold external vendors and delivery partners to their commitments and fit their work into our plans and releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ways of Working:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Improve how we plan, track and report on delivery across the technology organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A day in the life&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your day is split between the teams doing the work and the leaders deciding what the work should be. You might start with an engineering team, checking progress against the plan and clearing a blocker, then spend time with a product manager breaking a loyalty feature into deliverable stages. In the afternoon you could review a vendor’s delivery plan for a marketing technology integration, then update programme status ahead of an executive review, where you’ll set out where things stand, what is at risk and which decisions you need. You’ll leave with clear priorities and take them back to the teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What skills and experience do I need for this role?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly Skilled in technical programme or project management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with software engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at delivering customer-facing websites or mobile apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent at managing programmes across several teams, including planning, dependency management and release coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running prioritisation and backlog management with senior stakeholders and reporting on delivery to executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing both external vendors or delivery partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with websites and ecommerce at large scale: high traffic, many markets, or several brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering programmes in personalisation, loyalty or digital marketing technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering native mobile apps alongside web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in retail, particularly nutrition or beauty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of bringing clear structure to ambiguous, multi-team programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication, with the ability to explain a complex programme to executives in plain terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven't heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG please contact one of our &lt;span class="mark75xs2u5gf" data-markjs="true" data-ogac="" data-ogab="" data-ogsc="" data-ogsb=""&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:solution-engineer-rennes-ille-:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="fabric-text-color-mark" data-renderer-mark="true" data-text-custom-color="#36b37e"&gt;IDnow is a&lt;strong&gt; leader in digital identity and fraud prevention in Europe&lt;/strong&gt; with a mission to transform trust into the most powerful asset in the digital world, empowering enterprises with &lt;strong&gt;AI-driven, SaaS-based identity solutions that deliver scalable security, adaptive compliance, and real-time fraud prevention&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark="true"&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class="fabric-text-color-mark" data-renderer-mark="true" data-text-custom-color="#36b37e"&gt;Through its broad portfolio of digital identity and fraud prevention solutions, IDnow establishes, maintains and enriches trust throughout the customer journey, ensuring businesses can confidently and securely operate while leveraging digital identity to drive growth, security and scalability. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="fabric-text-color-mark" data-renderer-mark="true" data-text-custom-color="#36b37e"&gt;The company has &lt;strong&gt;offices in Germany, United Kingdom, Romania and France&lt;/strong&gt;, and is backed by renowned institutional investors, including Corsair Capital and Seventure Partners. Its &lt;strong&gt;portfolio of international clients spans a wide range of end markets&lt;/strong&gt; including financial services, telecommunications, travel &amp;amp; mobility, gaming, and other industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Rennes, France.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chance to apply closes:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; 6th of November 2026.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Solutions Engineer at IDnow is the &lt;strong&gt;client's trusted advisor through pre-sales and integration&lt;/strong&gt;. You design the solution the client will rely on, you give them confidence that it will work in their environment, and you become the person they turn to for technical and solution decisions. &lt;strong&gt;Your focus is the technical side of the journey up to the point where the client is live on our products, and you make that path smooth&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;hands-on, deeply technical role, and a commercial one&lt;/strong&gt;. Solutions Engineers carry a quota and are measured on two things: the deals they help win, and whether the client goes live successfully. &lt;strong&gt;You work hand in hand with Sales &lt;/strong&gt;to convince the client that our solution is the right one and to move them toward signature, and then you make sure they can use it well in production. You earn that through technical depth, but you are client-facing, credible and persuasive in a sales motion. You do this across our whole client base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire this role at more than one level. The core of the job is the same; the scope you own and the complexity you handle grow with your experience. This role carries real ownership across the client journey, and a say in how the work evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-testid="markdown-response"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Discover and Design&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery, qualifying conversion rates, false acceptance and rejection trade-offs, fraud exposure and integration constraints before proposing a solution,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end solution architectures that orchestrate document verification, digital identity, fraud signals, biometric authentication, eID and EU Digital Identity Wallet flows, and e-signature,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Link every technical choice to the client’s business objectives and Key Performance Indicators (KPIs), so proposals speak to outcomes rather than features,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define defensible architecture decisions covering fallback logic, data residency, scalability and performance,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Sales with proposals, Requests for Proposal (RFPs) and Requests for Information (RFIs), advising on which capabilities to combine and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Prove, Integrate and Go Live&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead proof-of-concept and pilot engagements, configuring Application Programming Interface (API) integrations, building Postman collections and managing sandbox environments,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate behaviour under realistic conditions and document what the client needs to go live,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide client developers through API and mobile Software Development Kit (SDK) integration, including webhooks, authentication and testing,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot integration issues by reading logs and diagnosing failures at the API and SDK level, rather than only forwarding them,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a living integration map of the client’s architecture, data flows and dependencies,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the account from signature to go-live, running the go-live plan and handing a documented account to Customer Success and Support at the end of hypercare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Advise and Enable&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted advisor relationships with business and technical stakeholders, from first conversation to go-live,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the client’s technical reality internally, feeding integration blockers, product gaps and pilot learnings back to Product and Sales teams,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the internal escalation team on deeper platform issues, arriving with clear technical context,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand alongside Sales in client meetings, addressing objections on integration effort, feasibility and alternatives,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve demo environments, architecture templates and integration guides, and mentor team members as the practice grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section class="container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-57a6ed87-9a65-412d-b52c-7002d3fb072d section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title" data-v-51f33a98="" data-v-fd08594a=""&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class="container-element section-element editable-element section_with_title-element-7525b616-170d-49ba-8189-de0a0bb7b01f section_with_title-element-default-section-with-title" data-v-51f33a98="" data-v-fd08594a=""&gt;
&lt;div class="editable-element-layer" data-v-607a5d63="" data-v-422f1a2b="" data-v-fd08594a=""&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="text-element editable-element editable-text-element" data-v-fd08594a=""&gt;
&lt;h2 class="text-element-header_text-2"&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You ask before you propose and qualify before you demo, turning ambiguous client requirements into the right technical solution. You take ownership of the client’s technical path from first conversation to production, and you explain complex systems in plain language to engineers and business leaders alike. You combine hands-on engineering depth with a commercial mindset, and you enjoy working alongside Sales to move a decision forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering or technical degree&lt;/strong&gt;, a Master’s degree in a relevant field, or equivalent practical experience,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years of experience in solutions engineering, technical consulting, or implementation and onboarding in SaaS&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally in identity, FinTech or security,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery and qualification skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to turn an ambiguous client requirement into the best technical solution,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution architecture skills&lt;/strong&gt;, including designing integration flows, explaining orchestration logic and defending trade-offs with a client’s engineers,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on technical skills&lt;/strong&gt; with APIs, Software Development Kits (SDKs) including &lt;strong&gt;mobile, and integration tooling&lt;/strong&gt; such as Postman and Git,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running a proof of concept and debugging an integration at the API or log level,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery discipline to run an integration and onboarding through to a committed go-live date, managing several client projects at once,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to translate technical complexity into plain language and reassure non-technical stakeholders,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business value awareness&lt;/strong&gt;, connecting the technical solution to client outcomes such as verification conversion, fraud loss or time to go-live,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client-facing presence, building trusted advisor relationships with business stakeholders such as Chief Digital Officers (CDOs) and Heads of Digital, and technical stakeholders such as Chief Technology Officers (CTOs), architects and platform engineers,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The instinct to own the client’s technical path end to end,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent English and full professional French are both hard requirements for the role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Additional European languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with identity verification, Know Your Customer (KYC), Know Your Business (KYB) or Anti-Money Laundering (AML) processes, including document verification, biometrics, liveness detection, eID and fraud detection,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in where digital identity is heading, including eIDAS 2.0, EU Digital Identity Wallets, the EU Anti-Money Laundering Regulation and General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mobile SDK delivery on iOS, Android or React Native,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of web development concepts, including frontend and backend architecture, webhooks and Open Authorisation (OAuth),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in mobility, FinTech, banking or other regulated industries,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of a programming language such as Python, Java or JavaScript, and of a cloud platform such as Amazon Web Services (AWS), Microsoft Azure or Google Cloud Platform (GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Use your full access to the mental health platform &lt;em&gt;nilo&lt;/em&gt;, including 1on1 sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value&lt;strong&gt; personal and professional development:&lt;/strong&gt; make full use of &lt;em&gt;Udemy&lt;/em&gt;, our training platform with 24/7 access and unlimited content/course consumption incl. certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We make your &lt;strong&gt;remote work comfy:&lt;/strong&gt; we provide support on equipment and offer flexible working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value collaboration &amp;amp; love to come together: regular&lt;strong&gt; onsite gatherings, internal initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; and summer parties to connect outside of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May your family require your attention or other reasons apply: use the benefit of our&lt;strong&gt; paid &lt;/strong&gt;special&lt;strong&gt; leave days.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy the possibility to combine work with a longer stay at your holiday destination or extend a weekend with our&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Workcation possibilities.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In addition to the perks &amp;amp; benefits above, we offer &lt;strong&gt;specific benefits that differ between our locations.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IDnow applies the principles of non-discrimination and equality: We strive to establish, maintain, and promote an open and inclusive recruitment process and working environment by respecting the principles of equal opportunities. Including but not limited to: race or ethnic origin, religion or convictions, gender identity or expression, citizenship, marital status, disability, age, or sexual orientation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:lead-support-engineer-lille-up:
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="22"&gt;Our &lt;strong data-path-to-node="22" data-index-in-node="4"&gt;Order and Inventory Management Team&lt;/strong&gt; is looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node="22" data-index-in-node="57"&gt;Support Engineer (f/m/d) - Domain Manager&lt;/strong&gt; on a &lt;strong data-path-to-node="22" data-index-in-node="104"&gt;Permanent Contract&lt;/strong&gt; based in &lt;strong data-path-to-node="22" data-index-in-node="132"&gt;Lille.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="23"&gt;Passionate about logistics innovation, our team of 10 designs and operates the global digital solutions orchestrating Decathlon's order and stock flows. Our impact: guaranteeing the right product in the right place at the right time for our stores, warehouses, and marketplaces worldwide. Our challenges: accelerating the group's digital transformation, integrating new business models (circular economy, wholesale), and preparing the transition to SAP S/4HANA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="24"&gt;YOUR FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="25"&gt;As a &lt;strong data-path-to-node="25" data-index-in-node="5"&gt;Support Engineer (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will ensure the stability, efficiency, and evolution of our order and stock orchestration tools. Your core responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="26"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="26,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="26,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Run Management &amp;amp; User Commitments:&lt;/strong&gt; Organize daily ticket resolution, ensure service level agreements (stock accuracy KPIs, dispatch timing), and provide dedicated support during peak commercial periods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="26,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="26,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Incident Resolution &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform root cause analysis, enhance monitoring tools (dashboards, control towers), and automate recurring tasks leveraging tech and AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="26,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="26,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Transformation Projects &amp;amp; SAP:&lt;/strong&gt; Challenge upcoming product features with the project team, drive updates on our SAP ECC module (SD/MM), and help prepare the S/4HANA migration planned for 2028.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="26,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="26,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Communication &amp;amp; On-Call Rotations:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain transparent communication with stakeholders during incidents or maintenance, and participate in on-call rotations for critical operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="27"&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="28"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="28,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="28,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Education &amp;amp; Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering degree (preferably in Computer Science) or equivalent experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="28,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="28,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Functional &amp;amp; Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of supply chain processes combined with proven experience on SAP modules (SD and MM).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="28,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="28,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Automation Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Passion for eliminating manual repetitive tasks, tracking data performance, and integrating AI into daily operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="28,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="28,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Team player spirit ("Play Collective"), clear communication, strong prioritization skills, and collaborative leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="28,4,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="28,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent English is mandatory (daily international scope).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="29"&gt;TECH STACK&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="30"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="30,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="30,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;ERP / Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; SAP ECC (SD &amp;amp; MM modules), S/4HANA roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="30,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="30,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Monitoring &amp;amp; Data:&lt;/strong&gt; Operational control towers, ticketing systems, and custom monitoring dashboards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="31"&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="32"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="32,0,0"&gt;Hybrid work organization (up to 2 days of remote work per week);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="32,2,0"&gt;Equipment provided in line with your role and our sustainability commitments (Mac, Windows, or Chromebook);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="32,3,0"&gt;A local project team within a global network (international career opportunities);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="32,4,0"&gt;Continuous learning and development (technical certifications in year one, internal/external training programs);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="32,5,0"&gt;Comprehensive compensation package (employee stock ownership scheme, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="34"&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO INCLUSION AND ACCESSIBILITY&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="35"&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams, and we continuously strive to foster and cultivate an inclusive and equitable workplace: this is why Inclusion is one of our Human Fundamentals. We encourage people of all backgrounds and abilities to apply, as we firmly believe that diversity of thought, culture, identity, and lived experience makes us stronger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="36"&gt;Decathlon is also committed to providing an inclusive and accessible recruitment process for all candidates. If you require any reasonable adjustments during the process, you can request them via the application form; your request will remain confidential and will not affect the outcome of your hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That's exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:sr-forward-deployed-ai-enginee:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;For over 20 years, Smartsheet has empowered teams to manage work seamlessly and scale solutions smarter. Now, in our most ambitious chapter yet, we are uniting human teams with AI agents. By orchestrating the work agents do best, automating manual tasks and uncovering insights at scale, we create the space for people to focus on what truly matters: judgment, creativity, and big thinking. That is magic at work, and it’s what we show up for every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You independently lead the most complex AI deployments Smartsheet undertakes. You own the full engagement lifecycle from technical discovery through production deployment through solutions org handoff. You architect multi-agent solutions, design client-personalized MCP resource packs, and build the Deployment Kits that transform how 200+ solutions consultants and partners operate. You mentor junior FDEs, drive the intelligence loop, and present field findings at weekly Applied AI strategy sessions. You are building a function, not filling a role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, multi-system AI deployments end-to-end scope, architect, build, validate, and manage the customer relationship throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the AI workshop program for your pod, customize modules per customer, lead technical sessions, translate outputs into production requirements, evolve content from field learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect multi-agent solutions selecting the right coordination pattern for each customer’s workflow characteristics and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design client-specific and industry-specific MCP resource packs that serve personalized intelligence from the server so every connected AI surface gets smarter for that customer automatically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Deployment Kit quality for your pod. If a kit is not documented well enough for a solutions consultant with no engineering background to follow, it isn’t done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Solutions Enablement Sprints: transfer AI deployment patterns to solutions consultants and partners with training materials and certification criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the intelligence loop: author strategic memos, present field findings weekly, contribute Agent Bricks and Skills, file RFCs for platform improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior FDEs on customer engagements, code reviews, and Deployment Kit quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6–10+ years production software engineering, &lt;/strong&gt;including 3+ years deploying AI/ML to production. Deep Python; strong TypeScript/JavaScript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record leading complex enterprise technical engagements. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ve managed customer relationships, navigated security reviews, and delivered production systems organisations depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep production LLM experience: &lt;/strong&gt;multi-agent orchestration, MCP/tool-use, RAG optimisation, evaluation frameworks, agent deployment at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System architecture expertise &lt;/strong&gt;spanning enterprise systems, cloud infrastructure, and AI services explainable to a CIO and a junior engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated ability to create reusable technical assets &lt;/strong&gt;that others use in production. You think in platforms, not projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong written and verbal communication. &lt;/strong&gt;Architecture documents, runbooks, strategic memos, training materials. Your Deployment Kits are your portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You leave teams better than you found them.&lt;/strong&gt; You make sure the people you work with understand what was built, why it works, and how to own it without you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to travel. &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;This role requires domestic and international travel approximately 25–50% of the time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elligible to work in the UK on an ongoing basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS or MS in Computer Science, a related field, or equivalent industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience founding or scaling an FDE/solutions engineering function.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical founder background. Databricks, AWS Bedrock, or Temporal experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep domain knowledge in healthcare, financial services, or government. Agent framework contributions (Strands SDK, LangChain, open-source MCP servers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in German/French language will be an added advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity of AI governance, ethics, and regulatory requirements (e.g. GDPR, UK/EU AI Act)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to Know Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Smartsheet, your ideas are heard, your potential is supported, and your contributions have real impact. You’ll have the freedom to explore, push boundaries, and grow beyond your role. We welcome diverse perspectives and nontraditional paths—because we know that impact comes from individuals who care deeply and challenge thoughtfully. When you’re doing work that stretches you, excites you, and connects you to something bigger, that’s magic at work. Let’s build what’s next, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Smartsheet is an Equal Opportunity (EEO) employer committed to fostering an inclusive environment with the best employees. It is our policy to provide equal employment opportunities to all qualified applicants in accordance with applicable laws in the US, UK, Australia, Germany, Costa Rica, Japan, Bulgaria, India, and Singapore. All qualified applicants will receive consideration without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, protected veteran or disabled status, or genetic information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there are preparations we can make to help ensure you have a comfortable and positive interview experience, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
